        "Title": "(光头的处方)47&apos;s Prescription",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126924564198",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository dd4e0a16-7b15-4b32-880d-945adbfe8bb0).Image",
        "Description": "此医生，假药集团担保人，非法获利过亿。上月曾向47提供无效药物。今日任务：为其开具“最终处方”。\r  &quot;This doctor acted as a guarantor for a fake drug factory, then sold the counterfeit medicines to patients through various channels, making a hundred million. Last month, 47 went to the hospital for a gunshot wound, and this doctor actually gave him fake meds. Today, 47 is going to prescribe some medicine for the doctor.&quot;",
